{"seq":1,"slug":"relational-databases","title":"关系型数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/relational-databases","wordCount":920,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"关系型数据库\">关系型数据库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关系型数据库是大多数系统的主数据存储，其核心竞争力在于事务保证与复杂查询能力。本篇的几个基础概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ACID</strong>：原子性、一致性、隔离性、持久性——在并发与故障场景下保证数据正确性的四根支柱。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离级别与代价</strong>：从 READ UNCOMMITTED 到 SERIALIZABLE，逐级消除脏读、不可重复读、幻读，但性能依次下降；MySQL InnoDB 默认 REPEATABLE READ，PostgreSQL 默认 READ COMMITTED。</li>\n<li><strong>B+ 树索引</strong>：所有数据在叶子节点且以链表相连，树高通常 3–4 层，千万级数据只需 3–4 次磁盘 IO；复合索引遵循最左前缀原则。</li>\n<li><strong>读写分离</strong>：主库承接写、从库分担读，代价是异步复制带来的复制延迟，写后立即读的场景需回主库。</li>\n<li><strong>分库分表</strong>：突破单机瓶颈，但引入跨分片 JOIN、分布式事务、全局唯一 ID、热点与再平衡等复杂性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心特性-acid\">核心特性：ACID</h2><p>关系型数据库（RDBMS）是大多数系统的主数据存储。其核心竞争力在于 ACID 事务保证——在并发和故障场景下确保数据的正确性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ACID((ACID))&#10;    A[Atomicity 原子性&lt;br/&gt;事务要么全部成功,要么全部失败]&#10;    C[Consistency 一致性&lt;br/&gt;事务将数据从一个有效状态&lt;br/&gt;转换到另一个有效状态]&#10;    I[Isolation 隔离性&lt;br/&gt;并发事务互不干扰]&#10;    D[Durability 持久性&lt;br/&gt;已提交的事务永久保存]&#10;&#10;    ACID --- A&#10;    ACID --- C&#10;    ACID --- I&#10;    ACID --- D\">graph TD\n    ACID((ACID))\n    A[Atomicity 原子性&lt;br/&gt;事务要么全部成功,要么全部失败]\n    C[Consistency 一致性&lt;br/&gt;事务将数据从一个有效状态&lt;br/&gt;转换到另一个有效状态]\n    I[Isolation 隔离性&lt;br/&gt;并发事务互不干扰]\n    D[Durability 持久性&lt;br/&gt;已提交的事务永久保存]\n\n    ACID --- A\n    ACID --- C\n    ACID --- I\n    ACID --- D</pre><h3 id=\"事务隔离级别\">事务隔离级别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔离级别</th>\n<th>脏读</th>\n<th>不可重复读</th>\n<th>幻读</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>READ UNCOMMITTED</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>READ COMMITTED</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REPEATABLE READ</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>✅可能</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SERIALIZABLE</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>❌阻止</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MySQL InnoDB 默认使用 REPEATABLE READ，PostgreSQL 默认使用 READ COMMITTED。大多数系统在 READ COMMITTED 即可满足业务需求，更高的隔离级别带来的性能损失通常不值得。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引原理\">索引原理</h2><p>索引是数据库性能的关键。没有索引的查询需要全表扫描，索引将查找时间从 O(n) 降低到 O(log n)。</p>\n<h3 id=\"b-树索引\">B+ 树索引</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Root[&quot;根节点&lt;br/&gt;30 | 60&quot;]&#10;    L1[&quot;10 | 20&quot;]&#10;    L2[&quot;40 | 50&quot;]&#10;    L3[&quot;70 | 80&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Root --&gt; L1&#10;    Root --&gt; L2&#10;    Root --&gt; L3&#10;&#10;    D1[1,5,8] --&gt; D2[10,15,18]&#10;    D2 --&gt; D3[20,25,28]&#10;    D3 --&gt; D4[30,35,38]&#10;    D4 --&gt; D5[40,45,48]&#10;&#10;    L1 --&gt; D1&#10;    L1 --&gt; D2&#10;    L1 --&gt; D3&#10;    L2 --&gt; D4&#10;    L2 --&gt; D5&#10;\">graph TD\n    Root[\"根节点&lt;br/&gt;30 | 60\"]\n    L1[\"10 | 20\"]\n    L2[\"40 | 50\"]\n    L3[\"70 | 80\"]\n\n    Root --&gt; L1\n    Root --&gt; L2\n    Root --&gt; L3\n\n    D1[1,5,8] --&gt; D2[10,15,18]\n    D2 --&gt; D3[20,25,28]\n    D3 --&gt; D4[30,35,38]\n    D4 --&gt; D5[40,45,48]\n\n    L1 --&gt; D1\n    L1 --&gt; D2\n    L1 --&gt; D3\n    L2 --&gt; D4\n    L2 --&gt; D5\n</pre><p>B+ 树是关系型数据库最常用的索引结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有数据存储在叶子节点</li>\n<li>叶子节点通过链表连接，支持范围查询</li>\n<li>树高通常为 3-4 层，千万级数据只需 3-4 次磁盘 IO</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"索引类型\">索引类型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const INDEX_TYPES = {&#10;  primaryKey: {&#10;    description: &#39;聚簇索引，数据按主键物理排序&#39;,&#10;    useCase: &#39;每张表必须有，通常是自增 ID 或 UUID&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  unique: {&#10;    description: &#39;唯一索引，不允许重复值&#39;,&#10;    useCase: &#39;邮箱、手机号等唯一字段&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  composite: {&#10;    description: &#39;复合索引，多列组合&#39;,&#10;    useCase: &#39;遵循最左前缀原则&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  covering: {&#10;    description: &#39;覆盖索引，包含查询所需的所有列&#39;,&#10;    useCase: &#39;避免回表查询&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  fullText: {&#10;    description: &#39;全文索引，支持文本搜索&#39;,&#10;    useCase: &#39;文章内容搜索&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> INDEX_TYPES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primaryKey: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'聚簇索引，数据按主键物理排序'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每张表必须有，通常是自增 ID 或 UUID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unique: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'唯一索引，不允许重复值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'邮箱、手机号等唯一字段'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  composite: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'复合索引，多列组合'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'遵循最左前缀原则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  covering: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'覆盖索引，包含查询所需的所有列'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'避免回表查询'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fullText: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全文索引，支持文本搜索'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    useCase: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'文章内容搜索'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"索引优化原则\">索引优化原则</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 复合索引遵循最左前缀原则&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_user_status_created&#10;ON orders (user_id, status, created_at);&#10;&#10;-- 以下查询可以使用索引&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 123;&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 123 AND status = &#39;active&#39;;&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE user_id = 123 AND status = &#39;active&#39; AND created_at &gt; &#39;2026-01-01&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 以下查询无法使用该索引（跳过了 user_id）&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = &#39;active&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 复合索引遵循最左前缀原则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_user_status_created</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders (user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 以下查询可以使用索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 123</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 123</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 123</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 以下查询无法使用该索引（跳过了 user_id）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"读写分离\">读写分离</h2><p>当读请求远多于写请求时（典型的 Web 应用读写比为 10:1 甚至 100:1），可以通过主从复制实现读写分离：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    App[应用层]&#10;    App --&gt;|写操作| Primary[(主库 Primary)]&#10;    App --&gt;|读操作| LB[读负载均衡]&#10;    LB --&gt; R1[(从库 Replica 1)]&#10;    LB --&gt; R2[(从库 Replica 2)]&#10;    LB --&gt; R3[(从库 Replica 3)]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R1&#10;    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R2&#10;    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R3\">flowchart TB\n    App[应用层]\n    App --&gt;|写操作| Primary[(主库 Primary)]\n    App --&gt;|读操作| LB[读负载均衡]\n    LB --&gt; R1[(从库 Replica 1)]\n    LB --&gt; R2[(从库 Replica 2)]\n    LB --&gt; R3[(从库 Replica 3)]\n    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R1\n    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R2\n    Primary --&gt;|异步复制| R3</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DatabasePool {&#10;  primary: Connection;&#10;  replicas: Connection[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ReadWriteSplitter {&#10;  private pool: DatabasePool;&#10;  private replicaIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;  constructor(pool: DatabasePool) {&#10;    this.pool = pool;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getWriteConnection(): Connection {&#10;    return this.pool.primary;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getReadConnection(): Connection {&#10;    const replica = this.pool.replicas[this.replicaIndex];&#10;    this.replicaIndex = (this.replicaIndex + 1) % this.pool.replicas.length;&#10;    return replica;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getStrongReadConnection(): Connection {&#10;    return this.pool.primary;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Connection {&#10;  query(sql: string, params?: unknown[]): Promise&lt;unknown&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DatabasePool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadWriteSplitter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DatabasePool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> replicaIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DatabasePool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getWriteConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.primary;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getReadConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> replica</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.replicas[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replicaIndex];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replicaIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.replicaIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.replicas.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replica;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getStrongReadConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.primary;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Connection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：异步复制存在<strong>复制延迟</strong>（通常毫秒到秒级）。对于&quot;写后立即读&quot;的场景（如用户修改资料后刷新页面），需要从主库读取以保证一致性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分库分表\">分库分表</h2><p>当单个数据库实例无法承载数据量或请求量时，需要进行分片（Sharding）：</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片策略\">分片策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 水平分片&#10;        App1[应用] --&gt; Router[分片路由]&#10;        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 0| S0[(Shard 0)]&#10;        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 1| S1[(Shard 1)]&#10;        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 2| S2[(Shard 2)]&#10;        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 3| S3[(Shard 3)]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 水平分片\n        App1[应用] --&gt; Router[分片路由]\n        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 0| S0[(Shard 0)]\n        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 1| S1[(Shard 1)]\n        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 2| S2[(Shard 2)]\n        Router --&gt;|user_id % 4 = 3| S3[(Shard 3)]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片方式</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围分片</td>\n<td>按 ID 范围分到不同分片</td>\n<td>范围查询高效</td>\n<td>容易出现热点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希分片</td>\n<td>对分片键取哈希后取模</td>\n<td>数据分布均匀</td>\n<td>范围查询需要跨分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录分片</td>\n<td>维护一个映射表</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>映射表本身成为瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分片带来的挑战\">分片带来的挑战</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const SHARDING_CHALLENGES = {&#10;  crossShardJoin: &#39;跨分片 JOIN 查询非常昂贵，需要在应用层聚合&#39;,&#10;  distributedTransaction: &#39;跨分片事务需要两阶段提交（2PC），性能低且复杂&#39;,&#10;  rebalancing: &#39;增加分片时需要数据迁移，可能导致服务中断&#39;,&#10;  uniqueId: &#39;全局唯一 ID 不能再依赖自增，需要 Snowflake 等分布式 ID 生成器&#39;,&#10;  hotspot: &#39;某些分片键可能导致数据分布不均（如热门用户）&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SHARDING_CHALLENGES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crossShardJoin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'跨分片 JOIN 查询非常昂贵，需要在应用层聚合'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distributedTransaction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'跨分片事务需要两阶段提交（2PC），性能低且复杂'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rebalancing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'增加分片时需要数据迁移，可能导致服务中断'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uniqueId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全局唯一 ID 不能再依赖自增，需要 Snowflake 等分布式 ID 生成器'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hotspot: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'某些分片键可能导致数据分布不均（如热门用户）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据库选型指南\">数据库选型指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[选择数据库] --&gt; Q1{数据模型?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|结构化/关系型| Q2{规模?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|单机可承载| PG[PostgreSQL / MySQL]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|需要水平扩展| Q3{一致性要求?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|强一致| Spanner[Google Spanner / CockroachDB]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|最终一致| Vitess[Vitess / TiDB]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|非结构化| NoSQL[见 NoSQL 章节]\">flowchart TD\n    Start[选择数据库] --&gt; Q1{数据模型?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|结构化/关系型| Q2{规模?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|单机可承载| PG[PostgreSQL / MySQL]\n    Q2 --&gt;|需要水平扩展| Q3{一致性要求?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|强一致| Spanner[Google Spanner / CockroachDB]\n    Q3 --&gt;|最终一致| Vitess[Vitess / TiDB]\n    Q1 --&gt;|非结构化| NoSQL[见 NoSQL 章节]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ACID</strong> 是关系型数据库的核心价值，事务隔离级别需要根据业务需求选择。</li>\n<li><strong>B+ 树索引</strong>是性能优化的关键，遵循最左前缀原则和覆盖索引策略。</li>\n<li><strong>读写分离</strong>适合读多写少的场景，但要注意复制延迟导致的一致性问题。</li>\n<li><strong>分库分表</strong>突破单机瓶颈，但引入了跨分片查询、分布式事务等复杂性。</li>\n<li>关系型数据库适合需要强一致性和复杂查询的核心业务数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关系型数据库","id":"关系型数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心特性：ACID","id":"核心特性-acid"},{"level":3,"text":"事务隔离级别","id":"事务隔离级别"},{"level":2,"text":"索引原理","id":"索引原理"},{"level":3,"text":"B+ 树索引","id":"b-树索引"},{"level":3,"text":"索引类型","id":"索引类型"},{"level":3,"text":"索引优化原则","id":"索引优化原则"},{"level":2,"text":"读写分离","id":"读写分离"},{"level":2,"text":"分库分表","id":"分库分表"},{"level":3,"text":"分片策略","id":"分片策略"},{"level":3,"text":"分片带来的挑战","id":"分片带来的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库选型指南","id":"数据库选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"REST、GraphQL 与 gRPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/networking-and-protocols/rest-graphql-grpc"},"next":{"title":"NoSQL 数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/storage-and-databases/nosql-databases"}}